// Copy this file to Secrets.xcconfig (which git ignores), fill in the values,
// and set it as a configuration file for the app target. Then add these to the
// app's Info.plist so the app can read them:
//   KROGER_CLIENT_ID     = $(KROGER_CLIENT_ID)
//   KROGER_CLIENT_SECRET = $(KROGER_CLIENT_SECRET)
// The app also needs NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription, for example:
//   "Your location is used to find the nearest store. It stays on your device."
KROGER_CLIENT_ID =
KROGER_CLIENT_SECRET =
